  "description": "After serving the kingdom for 300 years as the wolf goddess, Lauren is brutally abandoned once she is no longer deemed useful. But instead of a death sentence, she is secretly given a second chance to live as a normal beastkin. And like all female beastkin, she soon experiences her first heat, which results in a spontaneous night with a serpent stranger by the name of Alexander. Although Lauren wishes to put this mistake behind her, Alexander is desperate to find the wolfish woman he has now marked as his mate...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
